000010 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000020 PROGRAM-ID. GENERATE1.
000030 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000040 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000050 FILE-CONTROL.
000060     SELECT REPORT-FILE ASSIGN TO "generate1.txt"
000070         ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
000080     SELECT READ-BACK ASSIGN TO "generate1.txt"
000090         ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
000100 DATA DIVISION.
000110 FILE SECTION.
000120 FD  REPORT-FILE REPORT IS FRUIT-REPORT.
000130 FD  READ-BACK.
000140 01  PRINTED-LINE         PIC X(40).
000150 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000160 01  WS-FRUIT             PIC X(6).
000170 01  WS-BOXES             PIC 99.
000180 01  WS-PASS              PIC 9.
000190 01  END-OF-FILE          PIC X VALUE "N".
000200 REPORT SECTION.
000210 RD  FRUIT-REPORT
000220     CONTROLS ARE WS-FRUIT
000230     PAGE LIMIT IS 8 LINES
000240     HEADING 1 FIRST DETAIL 2 LAST DETAIL 8.
000250 01  TYPE IS PAGE HEADING.
000260     05  LINE NUMBER IS 1.
000270         10  COLUMN 1  PIC X(15) VALUE "PASS   FRUIT".
000280         10  COLUMN 6  PIC 9     SOURCE WS-PASS.
000290 01  BOX-LINE TYPE IS DETAIL.
000300     05  LINE NUMBER IS PLUS 1.
000310         10  COLUMN 8  PIC X(6)  SOURCE WS-FRUIT.
000320         10  COLUMN 15 PIC Z9    SOURCE WS-BOXES.
000330 01  TYPE IS CONTROL FOOTING WS-FRUIT.
000340     05  LINE NUMBER IS PLUS 1.
000350         10  COLUMN 1  PIC X(6)  VALUE "TOTAL".
000360         10  COLUMN 8  PIC X(6)  SOURCE WS-FRUIT.
000370         10  COLUMN 14 PIC ZZ9   SUM WS-BOXES.
000380 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000390 MAIN-PARA.
000400     OPEN OUTPUT REPORT-FILE
000410     PERFORM VARYING WS-PASS FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-PASS > 2
000420         INITIATE FRUIT-REPORT
000430         MOVE "APPLE" TO WS-FRUIT
000440         MOVE 4 TO WS-BOXES PERFORM GENERATE-ONE
000450         MOVE 6 TO WS-BOXES PERFORM GENERATE-ONE
000460         MOVE "PEAR" TO WS-FRUIT
000470         MOVE 3 TO WS-BOXES PERFORM GENERATE-ONE
000480         TERMINATE FRUIT-REPORT
000490     END-PERFORM
000500     CLOSE REPORT-FILE
000510     OPEN INPUT READ-BACK
000520     PERFORM UNTIL END-OF-FILE = "Y"
000530         READ READ-BACK
000540             AT END MOVE "Y" TO END-OF-FILE
000550             NOT AT END
000560                 DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(PRINTED-LINE TRAILING)
000570         END-READ
000580     END-PERFORM
000590     CLOSE READ-BACK
000600     STOP RUN.
000610 GENERATE-ONE.
000620*    Pass 1 prints every detail line; pass 2 only the totals.
000630     IF WS-PASS = 1
000640         GENERATE BOX-LINE
000650     ELSE
000660         GENERATE FRUIT-REPORT
000670     END-IF.
